		<name>CloudStream</name>
		<summary>Open-source Android application for streaming and downloading media.</summary>
		<desc>Cloudstream is an open-source Android application designed for streaming and downloading Movies, TV Shows, and Anime. Rather than hosting media, it relies on a modular extension system with custom providers.

Key features:

- Completely ad-free experience
- No analytics, telemetry, or user tracking
- Offline downloads for local media playback
- Full Chromecast support
- Integrated bookmarks, history, and episode tracking
- Modular extension system for external providers
- Optimized interface for both phones and Android TV
</desc>
