		<name>CloudStream (Pre-release)</name>
		<summary>Pre-release testing build for Cloudstream.</summary>
		<desc>Cloudstream Pre-release is the bleeding-edge version of Cloudstream. It includes the latest features, experimental updates, and bug fixes before they are pushed to the stable release. Suitable for testing and early adopters.

Key features:

- Bleeding-edge features and updates before public release
- Early access to experimental improvements and fixes
- Completely ad-free experience
- No analytics, telemetry, or user tracking
- Offline downloads for local media playback
- Full Chromecast support
- Integrated bookmarks, history, and episode tracking
- Modular extension system for external providers
- Optimized interface for both phones and Android TV</desc>
